flowchart LR
  A["Scout / Worker / Verifier<br/>observe real evidence"] --> B{"Same problem<br/>observed ≥2 times?"}
  B -->|No| C["Keep small observation"]
  B -->|Yes| D["Worker diagnoses cause<br/>and proposes prevention"]
  D --> E["CANDIDATE (not trusted)"]
  E --> F{"Current checks PASS<br/>and independent Verifier PASS?"}
  F -->|No| G["Keep unresolved candidate<br/>without new gate"]
  F -->|Yes, PR_READY| H["ACTIVE lesson"]
  H --> I["Next relevant /surgical goal:<br/>bounded advisory hint"]
  I --> J{"Same issue recurs?"}
  J -->|No| K["Keep using with evidence"]
  J -->|Yes| L["NEEDS_REVISION<br/>exclude from future hints"]
  L --> D
  C -. "new occurrence" .-> B
